---
title: "Two paid requests at once, one spending limit"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "At the same time" as all {
    state "Request 1" as r0 {
      s0: Asked
      s1: Checking the limit
      s2: Reserved: the AI is working
      s3: The AI is paid: cost not written yet
      s4: Failed unpaid: reservation still held
      s5: Done: reservation released
      s6: Cost written: reservation still held
      s7: The limit is reached
      [*] --> s0
      s0 --> s1: it reads what has been spent [unless Checking the limit]
      s1 --> s2: its worst case fits: it is held [when Asked or Done: reservation released]
      s2 --> s3: the AI fails, and is paid anyway or the AI answers, and is paid
      s2 --> s4: the AI fails, unpaid
      s3 --> s6: the failed call's cost is written or the answer and its cost are saved
      s4 --> s5: the reservation is released [unless Checking the limit]
      s6 --> s5: the reservation is released [unless Checking the limit]
      s1 --> s7: its worst case does not fit [unless Asked]
    }
    --
    state "Request 2" as r1 {
      s8: Asked
      s9: Checking the limit
      s10: Reserved: the AI is working
      s11: The AI is paid: cost not written yet
      s12: Failed unpaid: reservation still held
      s13: Done: reservation released
      s14: Cost written: reservation still held
      s15: The limit is reached
      [*] --> s8
      s8 --> s9: it reads what has been spent [unless Checking the limit]
      s9 --> s10: its worst case fits: it is held [when Asked or Done: reservation released]
      s10 --> s11: the AI fails, and is paid anyway or the AI answers, and is paid
      s10 --> s12: the AI fails, unpaid
      s11 --> s14: the failed call's cost is written or the answer and its cost are saved
      s12 --> s13: the reservation is released [unless Checking the limit]
      s14 --> s13: the reservation is released [unless Checking the limit]
      s9 --> s15: its worst case does not fit [unless Asked]
    }
  }
